{
  "version": "intent-vector-acceptance-v1",
  "provenance": "Handwritten synthetic cases by the implementation agent; separate from retrieval examples, not an independently reviewed or blind benchmark.",
  "cases": [
    {"id":"single-01","group":"single","text":"能否列一下你支持的功能？","expected":["general_chat"]},
    {"id":"single-02","group":"single","text":"多谢，暂时没有别的需求。","expected":["general_chat"]},
    {"id":"single-03","group":"single","text":"下班路上看到夕阳，感觉一切都挺好的。","expected":["small_talk"]},
    {"id":"single-04","group":"single","text":"我最近被工作搞得心情低落，只想吐槽一下。","expected":["small_talk"]},
    {"id":"single-05","group":"single","text":"第一次打开这个应用，应该从哪里入手？","expected":["onboarding"]},
    {"id":"single-06","group":"single","text":"尚未建立个人资料，可以一步一步引导我填写吗？","expected":["onboarding"]},
    {"id":"single-07","group":"single","text":"RPE这个指标表达的是什么？","expected":["concept_explanation"]},
    {"id":"single-08","group":"single","text":"力量练习中说的每组次数和总容量有什么关系？","expected":["concept_explanation"]},
    {"id":"single-09","group":"single","text":"从下周开始我只能周末去健身房，把新的可用时段存一下。","expected":["profile_update"]},
    {"id":"single-10","group":"single","text":"最近称重是68.5千克，个人信息里替换成这个最新值。","expected":["profile_update"]},
    {"id":"single-11","group":"single","text":"个人资料标成了女，其实我当初填的是男，修正录入错误。","expected":["profile_correction"]},
    {"id":"single-12","group":"single","text":"我发现你保存的身高多了一厘米，应当是178而不是179。","expected":["profile_correction"]},
    {"id":"single-13","group":"single","text":"未来五天我想每隔一天练一次，请排好具体项目。","expected":["training_plan"]},
    {"id":"single-14","group":"single","text":"每天只有半小时，给我规划一套在家做的运动安排。","expected":["training_plan"]},
    {"id":"single-15","group":"single","text":"刚游完800米用了24分钟，请作为一次锻炼存下来。","expected":["training_log"]},
    {"id":"single-16","group":"single","text":"昨天引体向上做了四组，每组六次，帮我入账。","expected":["training_log"]},
    {"id":"single-17","group":"single","text":"当前配速已经不吃力，下一次是否可以提高强度？","expected":["progression_decision"]},
    {"id":"single-18","group":"single","text":"同样的重量练了一个月，要保持还是往上加？","expected":["progression_decision"]},
    {"id":"single-19","group":"single","text":"今晚运动完饿了，有什么清淡又能补充营养的食物组合？","expected":["nutrition_advice"]},
    {"id":"single-20","group":"single","text":"一天摄入热量怎么分配到三顿更适合控制体重？","expected":["nutrition_advice"]},
    {"id":"single-21","group":"single","text":"中午已吃150克三文鱼和一个红薯，把这顿存起来。","expected":["nutrition_log"]},
    {"id":"single-22","group":"single","text":"今天的早餐是燕麦酸奶，帮我添加到食物摄入记录。","expected":["nutrition_log"]},
    {"id":"single-23","group":"single","text":"这两天精神很差又没睡够，今天练还是缓一缓？","expected":["recovery_check"]},
    {"id":"single-24","group":"single","text":"上一轮运动的酸胀还在，帮我判断身体准备好没有。","expected":["recovery_check"]},
    {"id":"single-25","group":"single","text":"跑着跑着心口发紧，呼吸困难，现在怎么办？","expected":["injury_or_risk"]},
    {"id":"single-26","group":"single","text":"刚做动作时脚踝扭伤，已经肿起来站不稳了。","expected":["injury_or_risk"]},
    {"id":"single-27","group":"single","text":"把周一到周日的坚持情况整理成一份阶段小结。","expected":["weekly_review"]},
    {"id":"single-28","group":"single","text":"近七日的运动和吃饭执行得怎样，整体分析一下。","expected":["weekly_review"]},
    {"id":"single-29","group":"single","text":"请比较最近四周体重和运动量的走势，做个总结。","expected":["monthly_review"]},
    {"id":"single-30","group":"single","text":"九月份整体锻炼有哪些进展和不足？","expected":["monthly_review"]},
    {"id":"single-31","group":"single","text":"把我以前保存过的运动条目找出来看看。","expected":["memory_query"]},
    {"id":"single-32","group":"single","text":"个人资料以前写的可用器械有哪些，调出来让我确认。","expected":["memory_query"]},
    {"id":"multi-01","group":"multi","text":"存一下刚骑的12公里，再告诉我运动后该吃些什么。","expected":["training_log","nutrition_advice"]},
    {"id":"multi-02","group":"multi","text":"先看看这一周完成得如何，然后给下个星期排个运动日程。","expected":["weekly_review","training_plan"]},
    {"id":"multi-03","group":"multi","text":"把晚上的牛肉面保存下来，也判断一下我的睡眠不足是否需要歇一天。","expected":["nutrition_log","recovery_check"]},
    {"id":"multi-04","group":"multi","text":"调出以前的深蹲数据，评估下次能不能加重量。","expected":["memory_query","progression_decision"]},
    {"id":"multi-05","group":"multi","text":"先把档案体重换成69千克，再讨论怎样安排每日蛋白摄入。","expected":["profile_update","nutrition_advice"]},
    {"id":"multi-06","group":"multi","text":"保存我刚跑的三公里，以及刚吃的香蕉和酸奶。","expected":["training_log","nutrition_log"]},
    {"id":"multi-07","group":"multi","text":"什么是训练负荷？另外看看我这几天累得要不要休息。","expected":["concept_explanation","recovery_check"]},
    {"id":"multi-08","group":"multi","text":"最近四周的整体效果总结一下，再建议下一阶段如何提高运动强度。","expected":["monthly_review","progression_decision"]},
    {"id":"neg-01","group":"negation","text":"别替我排运动日程，只把以前保存的条目展示出来。","expected":["memory_query"],"forbidden":["training_plan"]},
    {"id":"neg-02","group":"negation","text":"不需要保存这顿饭，我想知道减脂晚餐如何搭配。","expected":["nutrition_advice"],"forbidden":["nutrition_log"]},
    {"id":"neg-03","group":"negation","text":"不用更新我的个人资料，只解释体脂率代表什么。","expected":["concept_explanation"],"forbidden":["profile_update"]},
    {"id":"neg-04","group":"negation","text":"先别增加重量，单纯给我看之前的杠铃训练历史。","expected":["memory_query"],"forbidden":["progression_decision"]},
    {"id":"neg-05","group":"negation","text":"不用做阶段总结，给我拟一份后天的锻炼安排。","expected":["training_plan"],"forbidden":["weekly_review","monthly_review"]},
    {"id":"neg-06","group":"negation","text":"不要给我饮食建议，把今天吃的沙拉记录好就行。","expected":["nutrition_log"],"forbidden":["nutrition_advice"]},
    {"id":"quote-01","group":"quotation","text":"朋友说‘明天替我制定运动计划’，我只是转述他的话。","expected":[],"forbidden":["training_plan"]},
    {"id":"quote-02","group":"quotation","text":"‘把身高改成180’只是举例，不要修改我的任何资料。","expected":[],"forbidden":["profile_update","profile_correction"]},
    {"id":"quote-03","group":"quotation","text":"我看到‘记录今天跑步’这个按钮，请解释它干什么，别帮我保存。","expected":["concept_explanation"],"forbidden":["training_log"]},
    {"id":"quote-04","group":"quotation","text":"文章说‘膝盖痛也要坚持’，这是危险建议吗？我本人没有疼痛。","expected":["concept_explanation"],"forbidden":["training_plan"]},
    {"id":"context-01","group":"context","text":"按上次那个来就行。","expected":[]},
    {"id":"context-02","group":"context","text":"把第二个改了吧。","expected":[]},
    {"id":"context-03","group":"context","text":"好，确认。","expected":[]},
    {"id":"context-04","group":"context","text":"那条实际上不是六公里，是四公里。","expected":[]},
    {"id":"ood-01","group":"out_of_domain","text":"请计算深圳到广州的高铁票价。","expected":[]},
    {"id":"ood-02","group":"out_of_domain","text":"帮我写一段数据库索引优化的程序。","expected":[]},
    {"id":"ood-03","group":"out_of_domain","text":"今年有哪些值得读的科幻小说？","expected":[]},
    {"id":"ood-04","group":"out_of_domain","text":"我的路由器无法连接网络了。","expected":[]},
    {"id":"risk-01","group":"risk","text":"我现在胸闷，先别聊晚饭，告诉我该怎么办。","expected":["injury_or_risk"]},
    {"id":"risk-02","group":"risk","text":"脚踝肿着但是我想安排明天跑步，是否安全？","expected":["injury_or_risk","training_plan"]},
    {"id":"risk-03","group":"risk","text":"运动到一半头晕快昏过去了，请先帮我判断风险。","expected":["injury_or_risk"]},
    {"id":"risk-04","group":"risk","text":"已经受伤了还想加大训练负荷，有什么问题？","expected":["injury_or_risk","progression_decision"]}
